WEBVTT

00:00:01.559 --> 00:00:04.669
So I decided to rent the
Even Realities glasses,

00:00:04.679 --> 00:00:07.319
uh, the G2s, along with the R1 ring.

00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:09.330
Um, the price, living in Atlanta, Georgia,

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.599
the price was sixty-five dollars.

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:14.279
I wasn't sure whether I wanted the
glasses or not or what it all entailed,

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.849
so I did decide to rent.

00:00:15.859 --> 00:00:17.189
Um, it's been good.

00:00:17.199 --> 00:00:19.279
I got the package right
away, easy tracking.

00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:22.710
Um, what's great, they don't-- you don't
have to pay for it exactly till you

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.130
actually, I guess till you
receive the glasses and the ring.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.029
So that was a plus.

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:29.599
Um, the ring makes it a lot easier to

00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:33.109
actually use the glasses instead
of swiping your temples.

00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:34.290
Um, the fit was great.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.630
The first time I had a
pair of smart glasses.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.310
Um, I could see the innovation
and how it's going to be,

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.389
uh, more advanced, more of
a bigger product as it,

00:00:43.399 --> 00:00:45.150
uh, matures and stuff like that.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.909
So, uh, so far so good.

00:00:46.919 --> 00:00:47.849
No problems at all.
